      "name": "oracle_purifying_flames",
      "id": 5639,
      "name_zh": "涤罪之焰",
      "name_en": "Purifying Flames",
      "description_zh": "将目标身上一切不洁之物净化，对其造成大量魔法伤害，并使其在接下来的一段时间内逐渐恢复生命值。恢复的生命值总量将超过受到的伤害。可对友方和敌方单位施放。",
      "description_en": "Burns away impurities, dealing heavy magic damage to the target before causing them to regenerate health over time. The amount of health regenerated over its duration exceeds the amount of initial damage. Can be cast on enemies and allies.",
      "notes_zh": [
        "涤罪之焰的治疗效果可以相互叠加。",
        "涤罪之焰的伤害对友军不会致死。"
      ],
      "notes_en": [
        "The healing from Purifying Flames can be stacked with itself.",
        "The damage from Purifying Flames cannot be lethal to allies."
      ],
